  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Recommended: Plan Board + Evolution Tree",
      "items": [
        "One React Flow canvas, two zones: AI-drafted blocks on the left, version tree on the right",
        "The agent pipeline is a thin status rail, not the canvas",
        "Autopilot on by default; every human touch has a default that proceeds",
        "Steering hints queue for the next generation and never block the run",
        "Summary proves autonomy: Human inputs: 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "The 6 decisions (rec = recommended)",
      "items": [
        "1 Entry: auto-play replay (rec), pick replay or live, or spec box first",
        "2 Spec input: presets only in live mode (rec), free text, or editable presets",
        "3 Edit power: view and approve, pins + variant toggles (rec), or full rewire; auto-continue countdown (rec)",
        "4 Failure view: expected vs got table (rec), waveform viewer, or log only",
        "5 Loop shape: single refine chain, or population tree (rec if the Oct 18 PPA gate passes)",
        "6 Winner: AI picks, user picks from the Pareto front, or AI picks + user override (rec); output as zip (rec)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Three canvas concepts",
      "items": [
        "A, Architecture canvas: sketch the chip with AI. Effort M. Risk: edits that change nothing",
        "B, Pipeline canvas: mission control for the loop. Effort S. Reordering stages is fake freedom",
        "C, Evolution canvas: steer the design search. Effort M. Needs the population loop",
        "Hybrid of A-lite + C, with B as a rail, is the recommendation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Canvas tech",
      "items": [
        "React Flow (@xyflow/react, MIT) + Zustand + dagre",
        "tldraw ruled out: production license key, not open source",
        "Excalidraw ruled out: no typed custom nodes",
        "AI edits through a closed op set: add_node, connect, move_node, update_status, remove",
        "Live SSE and golden replay share one reducer",
        "Once a user moves a node, the AI may update its data but never its position"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Demo guardrails",
      "items": [
        "Never open on a blank canvas",
        "12 visible nodes or fewer; collapse the rest",
        "Every AI change shows a diff",
        "Clicks alone must finish the story; dragging is optional",
        "No live LLM call on the replay path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Ship by Oct 25 vs stretch",
      "items": [
        "Ship: replay landing, Plan Board with countdown, Evolution Tree, diff drawer, EQY badge, preset live mode, zip export",
        "Stretch: pins that truly replan the RTL, drag to fuse, fork a live run, waveform viewer, free-text specs"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not yet confirmed",
      "items": [
        "Nemotron structured JSON output on Nebius (tool calling is documented)",
        "Chipmind, Overture and Miro features come from press or listing pages only",
        "Make one real Nebius tool call this week"
      ]
    }
  ]
}